# bhotkeys-start starts bosd, the listener, and the bvwm apply script.
# Super+T and the tile chords are bvwm keys.
# default-config/tiling binds them.

DestroyFunc BhotkeysSessionStart
AddToFunc   BhotkeysSessionStart
+ I Test (x bhotkeys-start) Exec exec bhotkeys-start bvwm

AddToFunc StartFunction
+ I BhotkeysSessionStart
